 $ crest in.xyz --gfn2 --alpb water --chrg -2 --uhf 0 --noreftopo -T 8

  --gfn2               : Use of GFN2-xTB requested.
  --alpb water : implicit solvation
  --chrg -2
  --uhf 0
  -T 8 (CPUs/Threads selected)

